<title>USA: Amarillo feeder cattle prices steady-off $1 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Amarillo feeder cattle prices steady-off $1 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Early sales feeder steers and heifers under 600 lbs steady to $1.00 lower compared with last week, over 600 lbs not well tested, USDA said.</p>
<p>Bulk supply Medium and Large 1-2 350-800 lb feeder steers and 350-700 lbs feeder heifers.</p>
<p>Trade active and demand good.</p>
<p>Receipts: 2,500</p>
<p>Feeder Steers Medium and Large 1 two pkgs 317-358 lbs 96.00, two pkgs 320-383 lbs 110.00-115.00; 400-500 lbs 90.00-97.00; 500-600 lbs 83.00- 87.00; load 628 lbs 84.50; pkg and part load 715-721 lbs 80.00; part load 804 lbs 79.75.</p>
<p>Medium and Large 1-2 400-500 lbs 85.50-89.00; few 500-600 lbs 83.00- 85.50; few 600-700 lbs 80.00-82.00; pkg and load 802-864 lbs 73.75-78.75. Small and Medium 1-2 pkg 296 lbs 97.00; 300-400 lbs 85.00-92.50; 400- 500 lbs 84.00-86.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers Medium and Large 1 pkg 337 lbs 92.00;</p>
<p>400-500 lbs 79.00-83.00; 500-600 lbs 78.50-81.75; pkg 615 lbs 82.25; 700-800 lbs 74.00- 77.20. Medium and Large 1-2 few 200-300 lbs 84.00-87.00; 300-400 lbs 75.50- 83.00; 400-500 lbs 77.00-82.50; pkg 543 lbs 80.75; few 600-700 lbs 70.50- 78.00; pkg 763 lbs 72.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
